OL,8,BLahti school breaks Finnish law with 8-
OL,9,Bhour day for seventh-graders           
OL,10,GSome 13-year-old students at the school
OL,11,Ghad eight hours of classes on Mondays, 
OL,12,Gexceeding the legally-mandated limit by
OL,13,Gone hour.                              
